Description: Local-first desktop dictation for Ubuntu GNOME Wayland
 Requires Lemonade or another OpenAI-compatible server installed
 and running separately on this computer, with audio transcription, chat
 completions and model-discovery metadata supported by LemonVox. Generic API
 compatibility alone is insufficient. Local and remote HTTP/HTTPS endpoints are accepted.
 Lemonade 2026.44.1 is the tested baseline; other servers are unverified.
 The GNOME extension pastes completed dictation at current focus without
 sending Enter. Copy is available if paste cannot be dispatched.

